        source {
            htmlCode:
                ```html
                <div style="padding: 24px; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0;">Email &amp; Invoice Processing</h2>
                    <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px;">Monitor incoming supplier emails, automated attachment ingestion, and OCR parsing status.</p>
